{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22270","headline":"初下汉江舟中作寄两省给舍 · 白居易","name":"初下汉江舟中作寄两省给舍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋水淅红粒，朝烟烹白鳞。\n一食饱至夜，一卧安达晨。\n晨无朝谒劳，夜无直宿勤。\n不知两掖客，何似扁舟人。\n尚想到郡日，且称守土臣。\n犹须副忧寄，恤隐安疲民。\n朞年庶报政，三年当退身。\n终使沧浪水，濯吾缨上尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22270.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22270","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}